{
    "title": "HHAeXchange+",
    "description": "The caregiver app for homecare, self direction, or Care Insights in Texas, Illinois, Michigan and Massachusetts. \r\n\r\nLearn more about each mode below. \r\n\r\nHHAeXchange+ provides a simple, fast, and secure mobile experience to connect caregivers with homecare agencies or self-directed employers. To satisfy the 21st Century Cures Act requirement, this app will only record a caregiver\u2019s location when they clock-in and clock-out. \r\n\r\nHHAeXchange+ has three modes: \r\n\r\n-- Agency mode, for caregivers employed by homecare agencies \r\n-- Self-Direction mode, for family and friends serving as caregivers  \r\n-- Care Insights mode, for payers that need member-related questions answered and recorded  \r\n\r\nAgency mode for homecare empowers caregivers to:  \r\n\r\n-- Clock in and clock out with location services or FOB \r\n-- Manage their schedule on-the-go \r\n-- Create unscheduled visits \r\n-- Record plan of care duties \r\n-- Conduct skilled or non-skilled visits \r\n-- View member information like demographics, plan of care tasks, or get directions to the member\u2019s home \r\n-- Communicate with agencies in real-time through the Two-Way Chat Message Center \r\n \r\n\r\nSelf-Direction mode allows caregivers to:  \r\n\r\n-- Start and end a shift \r\n-- View consumer information  \r\n\r\n \r\nCare Insights mode allows caregivers to:  \r\n\r\n-- Provide responses to member-related health and environment questions \r\n-- Proactively monitor member health \r\n-- Measure against the progress on a specific plan of care to improve member outcomes \r\n\r\nDisclaimer: HHAeXchange+ requires an active internet connection (3G, 4G, or WiFi)",
    "descriptionHTML": "The caregiver app for homecare, self direction, or Care Insights in Texas, Illinois, Michigan and Massachusetts. <br><br>Learn more about each mode below. <br><br>HHAeXchange+ provides a simple, fast, and secure mobile experience to connect caregivers with homecare agencies or self-directed employers. To satisfy the 21st Century Cures Act requirement, this app will only record a caregiver\u2019s location when they clock-in and clock-out. <br><br>HHAeXchange+ has three modes: <br><br>-- Agency mode, for caregivers employed by homecare agencies <br>-- Self-Direction mode, for family and friends serving as caregivers  <br>-- Care Insights mode, for payers that need member-related questions answered and recorded  <br><br>Agency mode for homecare empowers caregivers to:  <br><br>-- Clock in and clock out with location services or FOB <br>-- Manage their schedule on-the-go <br>-- Create unscheduled visits <br>-- Record plan of care duties <br>-- Conduct skilled or non-skilled visits <br>-- View member information like demographics, plan of care tasks, or get directions to the member\u2019s home <br>-- Communicate with agencies in real-time through the Two-Way Chat Message Center <br> <br><br>Self-Direction mode allows caregivers to:  <br><br>-- Start and end a shift <br>-- View consumer information  <br><br> <br>Care Insights mode allows caregivers to:  <br><br>-- Provide responses to member-related health and environment questions <br>-- Proactively monitor member health <br>-- Measure against the progress on a specific plan of care to improve member outcomes <br><br>Disclaimer: HHAeXchange+ requires an active internet connection (3G, 4G, or WiFi)",
